' ==============================================================================
' PROJECT : FARMELY – AGRITECH PLOT RENTAL & CULTIVATION EXPERIENCE TRACKER
' FILE    : use-case-diagram-v2.puml   (ISP392 – FPT University)
' VERSION : 2.0  |  5 Diagrams  |  UML 2.5  |  NO-SPAGHETTI
'
' 4 Human Actors  : Customer (KH), Agri Expert (CGNN),
'                    Field Staff (CVLĐ), Admin (AD)
